  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of life-saving protection and shelter assistance to IDPs in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide protection and shelter/non-food items assistance to vulnerable communities affected by conflict in Myanmar. This UNHCR project provides protection monitoring, legal and psychosocial support, and access to safe shelter, among other activities. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 115,000 people in the Protection sector and 5,150 people in the Shelter and Non-Food Items sector.</narrative>
  </description>
